abstract: >-
  Blender extension adapted from DICOMator for generating synthetic dental
  DICOM CT/CBCT-like series from 3D mesh models, with dental materials and
  weight-painted tissue behavior.
keywords: [DICOM, CBCT, dentistry, Blender, synthetic imaging, dental education]

